    "title": "Autumn on Parade: Where Community Spirit Takes Center Stage - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Peggy Werner ,\n11 hours ago For 56 years, Autumn on Parade has celebrated a small town in a way that grows bigger every year with new vendors, more attendees and a greater spirit of community pride. “Our community has a special passion for this festival and all of the enjoyment it brings to people who visit from near and far,” says Meggan Dickson, marketing director and board member. “People save the date and plan special gatherings around the festival. There’s definitely a buzz in the air when fall comes around.” Read full article",
